OL,3,AAI firm Anthropic about to make US
OL,4,Astock market debut with valuation of
OL,5,A$1.5tn
OL,6,
OL,7,FAI firm Anthropic is being listed
OL,8,Fpublicly for the first time today, with
OL,9,Ftrading in New York to begin from 14:30
OL,10,FGMT (09:30 ET)
OL,12,FThe company behind AI product Claude
OL,13,Fhas been valued at $1.5tn (#1.14tn)
OL,14,Fafter raising a record $81bn ahead of
OL,15,Fits stock market debut
OL,17,FThe flotation is being seen as a
OL,18,Fcrucial test for the AI sector, with
OL,19,FAnthropic the first purely AI-focused
OL,20,Ffirm to sell shares publicly
